# 🚀 Kubernetes Deployment: Python Website

This repository contains Kubernetes manifests to deploy a simple web application (`python-website`) on **Minikube** or **kind**.

---

## 📦 Prerequisites

- [Docker](https://docs.docker.com/get-docker/)
- [kubectl](https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/tools/)
- [Minikube](https://minikube.sigs.k8s.io/docs/) **or** [kind](https://kind.sigs.k8s.io/)
- Source code for your app with a Dockerfile

---

## ⚙️ 1. Start Your Cluster

### 🧩 Option A — Minikube
```bash
minikube start

eval $(minikube docker-env)
docker build -t python-website:latest .


kubectl apply -f deployment.yml
kubectl apply -f service.yml


kubectl get svc python-website-service

minikube service python-website-service
